<body><div class="app">
<header class="top"><div class="brand">✨ Mindful Pets</div><div class="stats"><div class="pill">🔥 <b id="streak">0</b></div><div class="pill">⭐ <b id="stars">0</b></div><div class="pill">🪙 <b id="coins">0</b></div></div></header>
<main class="main">
<section id="home" class="view active"><div id="focusBanner" class="focus-banner">Welcome back. The practice was paused while this app was not visible.</div><div class="hero"><div id="petAvatar" class="pet">🐱</div><h1 id="petName">Whiskers</h1><p class="small" id="petLevel">Friendship level 1</p><div id="petMessage" class="pet-message">I’m happy you’re here! Shall we practice or play?</div><div class="meters"><div class="meterline"><span>Energy</span><div class="bar"><div id="healthFill" class="fill health"></div></div><b id="healthN"></b></div><div class="meterline"><span>Happiness</span><div class="bar"><div id="happyFill" class="fill happy"></div></div><b id="happyN"></b></div><div class="meterline"><span>Friendship</span><div class="bar"><div id="friendFill" class="fill friend"></div></div><b id="friendN"></b></div></div></div><div class="grid2"><button class="btn blue" onclick="openPractice('breathing')">💨 Breathe</button><button class="btn green" onclick="openPractice('meditation')">🧘 Meditate</button><button class="btn gold" onclick="openFeed()">🍎 Feed</button><button class="btn purple" onclick="playPet()">💖 Play</button></div><div id="charlieGoal" class="goal-card"></div><div class="section-title"><h2>Today’s gentle mission</h2></div><div class="card" id="mission"></div><div class="special-reward">🎁 Practice for 10 minutes to earn a Calm Treasure. Complete 15 minutes for a Super Calm Treasure!</div></section>
<section id="market" class="view"><div class="section-title"><h2>Marketplace</h2></div><div id="marketTabs" class="tabs"></div><div id="marketGrid" class="cards"></div></section>
<section id="collection" class="view"><div class="section-title"><h2>My collection</h2></div><div id="petCollection" class="cards"></div><div class="section-title"><h2>Badges</h2></div><div id="badgeGrid" class="cards"></div></section>
<section id="settings" class="view"><div class="section-title"><h2>Parent & settings</h2></div><div class="card" style="text-align:left"><div class="setup"><label>Child nickname<input id="childName" maxlength="18"></label><label>Age group<select id="ageGroup"><option value="5-7">5–7</option><option value="8-10">8–10</option><option value="11-12">11–12</option></select></label><label class="setting-item"><input id="buddyToggle" type="checkbox"><span class="setting-copy"><b>Practice with my pet</b><small>Show the selected pet quietly breathing or meditating alongside the child.</small></span></label><label class="setting-item"><input id="soundToggle" type="checkbox"><span class="setting-copy"><b>Game and reward sounds</b><small>Play cheerful sounds for rewards, games, feeding, purchases, and completed activities.</small></span></label><label class="setting-item"><input id="petSignalToggle" type="checkbox"><span class="setting-copy"><b>Pet completion sound</b><small>Let the pet bark, meow, chirp, or make its special sound when practice finishes.</small></span></label><label class="setting-item"><input id="hapticToggle" type="checkbox"><span class="setting-copy"><b>Gentle vibration</b><small>Use short vibrations for catches, treasures, and completed practices on supported devices.</small></span></label><label class="setting-item"><input id="motionToggle" type="checkbox"><span class="setting-copy"><b>Use fewer animations</b><small>Reduce pet movement, celebrations, and decorative motion for a calmer screen.</small></span></label><button class="btn purple" onclick="saveSettings()">Save settings</button><button class="btn soft" onclick="exportData()">Export offline backup</button><button class="btn soft" onclick="document.getElementById('importFile').click()">Import backup</button><input id="importFile" type="file" accept="application/json" hidden onchange="importData(event)"><button class="btn soft" onclick="openPinSetup()">Set or change parent PIN</button><button class="btn danger" onclick="requestProtectedAction('reset')">Reset all progress</button></div></div><div class="section-title"><h2>This week</h2></div><div class="card weekly-grid" id="weeklySummary"></div><div class="section-title"><h2>Recent practice record</h2></div><div class="card parent-log" id="parentLog"></div><div class="notice">Privacy: all progress stays in this browser unless a parent exports a backup. Privacy: This app does not use the camera or microphone. Practice presence is estimated using app visibility and occasional mindful checks. It cannot confirm whether someone is truly meditating. All progress remains on this device unless a parent exports a backup. Pets can become gently tired, but never critically sick and never blame the child.</div></section>
<section id="practice" class="view"><div class="practice"><h2 id="practiceTitle">Practice</h2><p id="practiceGuide" class="small"></p><div class="buddy-zone"><div id="buddyPet" class="buddy-pet">🐱</div><div id="buddyBubble" class="buddy-bubble">I will practice quietly with you.</div></div><div id="orb" class="orb">Ready</div><div id="timer" class="timer" role="timer" aria-label="Practice time remaining" aria-atomic="true">05:00</div><div id="a11yAnnounce" class="sr-only" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div><div class="participation"><b>Practice presence</b><div id="participationBar" class="participation-bar" role="progressbar" aria-label="Practice presence" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="100"><div id="participationFill" class="participation-fill"></div></div><div id="participationText" class="small">App visible • Practice running</div></div><div id="presenceCard" class="presence-card"><b id="presencePrompt">Quick mindful check</b><p id="presenceInstruction">Tap the matching symbol to continue.</p><div id="presenceChoices" class="check"></div></div><p id="integrityText" class="notice">This app can check attention and app visibility, but it cannot prove someone is meditating. If the app is hidden or a check is missed, the practice pauses.</p><div style="width:100%" class="grid2"><button class="btn soft" onclick="pauseResume()" id="pauseBtn">Pause</button><button class="btn danger" onclick="quitPractice()">End</button></div></div></section>
</main>
<nav class="bottom"><button class="nav active" data-view="home"><span>🏡</span>Home</button><button class="nav" data-view="market"><span>🏪</span>Market</button><button class="nav" data-view="collection"><span>🎒</span>Collection</button><button class="nav" data-view="settings"><span>⚙️</span>Settings</button></nav>
<div id="chooseModal" class="modal"><div class="sheet"><h2 id="chooseTitle">Choose a practice</h2><p id="chooseIntro" class="small">Your pet will practice with you. Choose the time that feels right today.</p><div id="practiceOptions" class="list"></div><div class="notice">🌱 Five minutes builds the habit. 🎁 Ten minutes unlocks a Calm Treasure. ✨ Fifteen minutes unlocks a Super Calm Treasure.</div><button class="btn soft" onclick="closeModal('chooseModal')">Close</button></div></div>
<div id="feedModal" class="modal"><div class="sheet"><h2>Food pantry</h2><div id="pantry" class="list"></div><button class="btn soft" onclick="closeModal('feedModal')">Close</button></div></div>
<div id="checkModal" class="modal"><div class="sheet"><h2>Nice work showing up! 🎉</h2><p>How do you feel now? Any answer is okay.</p><div class="check"><button class="btn soft" onclick="finishCheck('calm')">😌 Calm</button><button class="btn soft" onclick="finishCheck('happy')">😊 Happy</button><button class="btn soft" onclick="finishCheck('sleepy')">😴 Sleepy</button><button class="btn soft" onclick="finishCheck('same')">🙂 About the same</button></div></div></div>
